                        "difficultyIds": "a0f7d178f7b728b8bba7ef20ddeca62d",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe client would avoid pressure on the irritated area and needs to wear loose-fitting clothing. Specific primary health care provider instructions would be necessary if an alteration in skin integrity occurred as a result of the radiation therapy. Options 1, 2, and 3 are accurate measures to implement after radiation therapy.",
